    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-26T00:35:15Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">When borrowing a tool from a neighbour, agree a return time as well as the loan; it makes sharing easier to plan and avoids awkward uncertainty.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#3115ee1060f254b2944d2587d215b55e5191dcda21c486863d66daafaac38826</id>
    <title>Hopeful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-26T00:35:15Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-2" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The Japanese art of origami turns one sheet into intricate forms through folds alone; its playful engineering shows how constraint can spark remarkable invention.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#c4306463fe4616a1692a0bc4c443507923ded40df544907d7618d7c4e7601571</id>
    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-11-26T00:35:15Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">For a quick sound experiment, hum while gently pinching your nose, then release it; notice how the nasal passage changes the resonance you hear.</div>
    </content>
